{"es": {"title": "SOBRE NOSOTROS", "meta_title": "Sobre Carbon | Nuestra Historia y Filosofía", "meta_description": "Carbon une la influencia europea con las tendencias actuales, con ropa y accesorios que se adaptan a tu estilo de vida.", "body_html": "<style>\n  /* =========================\n     REMOVE SHOPIFY DEFAULT ABOUT TITLE / GAP\n  ========================== */\n  #MainContent h1:not(.ca-hero-title),\n  main h1:not(.ca-hero-title),\n  .main-page-title,\n  .page-title,\n  .title-wrapper,\n  .title-wrapper-with-link,\n  .page-header,\n  .page-width--narrow > h1:first-child,\n  .page-width > h1:first-child {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n\n  #MainContent .page-width:has(.carbon-about-final),\n  #MainContent .page-width--narrow:has(.carbon-about-final),\n  #MainContent .rte:has(.carbon-about-final),\n  #MainContent .main-page:has(.carbon-about-final),\n  #MainContent .shopify-section:has(.carbon-about-final),\n  #MainContent [class*=\"section-\"]:has(.carbon-about-final) {\n    max-width: none !important;\n    width: 100% !important;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n  }\n\n  .carbon-about-final {\n    width: 100vw;\n    margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);\n    margin-right: calc(50% - 50vw);\n    margin-top: -208px !important;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #111;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 5;\n  }\n\n  .carbon-about-final * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .ca-wrap {\n    max-width: 1440px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 34px;\n  }\n\n  /* =========================\n     HERO\n  ========================== */\n  .ca-hero {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    min-height: 780px;\n    height: 55vw;\n    max-height: 880px;\n    background: #000;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .ca-hero picture,\n  .ca-hero img {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .ca-hero img {\n    object-fit: cover;\n    object-position: center 47%;\n    filter: brightness(1.2) contrast(1.04);\n  }\n\n  .ca-hero::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    background:\n      linear-gradient(\n        90deg,\n        rgba(0,0,0,.64) 0%,\n        rgba(0,0,0,.54) 28%,\n        rgba(0,0,0,.23) 50%,\n        rgba(0,0,0,.05) 75%,\n        rgba(0,0,0,.04) 100%\n      );\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n\n  .ca-hero-content {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-hero-copy {\n    max-width: 760px;\n    padding-left: clamp(34px, 6vw, 92px);\n    padding-right: 24px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-eyebrow {\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: .18em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-hero-title {\n    display: block !important;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: clamp(58px, 5.2vw, 86px);\n    line-height: .95;\n    letter-spacing: -.045em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    margin: 0 0 22px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-hero-title span {\n    display: block;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .ca-hero-text {\n    color: #fff;\n    max-width: 620px;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    margin: 0 0 30px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-buttons {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 14px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n\n  .ca-btn {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n    min-width: 220px;\n    min-height: 58px;\n    padding: 0 28px;\n    border: 1px solid #fff;\n    text-decoration: none !important;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: .03em;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-btn-white {\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #000 !important;\n  }\n\n  .ca-btn-outline {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: #fff !important;\n  }\n\n  .ca-btn-outline-dark {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: #111 !important;\n    border-color: #111;\n  }\n\n  /* =========================\n     OUR STORY + IMAGE GRID\n  ========================== */\n  .ca-story {\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 92px 0 0;\n  }\n\n  .ca-story-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr;\n    gap: 84px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-story h2,\n  .ca-values h2,\n  .ca-visit h2,\n  .ca-final h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(38px, 3.4vw, 58px);\n    line-height: 1.02;\n    letter-spacing: -.04em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    margin: 0 0 26px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-story p {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    color: #222;\n    margin: 0 0 20px;\n    max-width: 590px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-story-image {\n    width: 100%;\n    min-height: 520px;\n    background-image: url(\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_09_04_04_PM.png?v=1781312658\");\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: center;\n    background-color: #111;\n  }\n\n  .ca-strip {\n    padding: 38px 0 78px;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  .ca-strip-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-strip-img {\n    min-height: 360px;\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: center;\n    background-color: #111;\n  }\n\n  .ca-img-left {\n    background-image: url(\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_08_49_56_PM.png?v=1781311828\");\n  }\n\n  .ca-img-middle {\n    background-image: url(\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/image_10_23c03a5f-148d-4609-b7b5-c4edd6c3da1a.png?v=1781294277\");\n  }\n\n  .ca-img-right {\n    background-image: url(\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_12_30_10_AM.png?v=1781252368\");\n  }\n\n  .ca-strip-caption {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 26px;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    color: #111;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n\n  /* =========================\n     VALUES\n  ========================== */\n  .ca-values {\n    background: #f5f5f5;\n    padding: 82px 0 96px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-values h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(42px, 4vw, 68px);\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  .ca-values-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 30px;\n    margin-top: 48px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-value-card {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid #d8d8d8;\n    padding: 58px 38px !important;\n    min-height: 360px !important;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-value-icon {\n    width: 120px !important;\n    height: 120px !important;\n    margin: 0 auto 28px !important;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-value-icon img {\n    width: 120px !important;\n    height: 120px !important;\n    display: block;\n    object-fit: contain !important;\n  }\n\n  .ca-value-card h3 {\n    margin: 0 0 18px;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: .02em;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n\n  .ca-value-card p {\n    font-size: 26px !important;\n    line-height: 1.55 !important;\n    max-width: 420px !important;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    color: #222;\n    font-weight: 600 !important;\n  }\n\n  /* =========================\n     VISIT\n  ========================== */\n  .ca-visit {\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n\n  .ca-visit-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: .95fr 1.05fr;\n    min-height: 520px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-visit-copy {\n    padding: clamp(50px, 6vw, 90px);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-visit-copy h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(42px, 4vw, 66px);\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-visit-copy p {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    max-width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto 34px;\n    color: #222;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-visit-photo {\n    min-height: 520px;\n    background: #111;\n    background-image: url(\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_12_43_51_AM.png?v=1781252379\");\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-visit-copy .ca-buttons {\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-visit-copy .ca-btn {\n    min-width: 220px;\n    min-height: 60px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    padding: 0 30px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-visit .ca-btn-outline-dark {\n    border-width: 1px;\n  }\n\n  /* =========================\n     FINAL CTA\n  ========================== */\n  .ca-final {\n    position: relative;\n    background: #030303;\n    color: #fff;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 74px 24px 82px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .ca-final::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -120px;\n    top: 20px;\n    width: 420px;\n    height: 420px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.055);\n    transform: rotate(30deg);\n  }\n\n  .ca-final h2 {\n    color: #fff;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-final p {\n    max-width: 760px;\n    margin: 0 auto 28px;\n    color: #ddd;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n\n  .ca-final .ca-btn {\n    min-width: 220px;\n  }\n\n  /* =========================\n     MOBILE\n  ========================== */\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n    .carbon-about-final {\n      margin-top: -132px !important;\n    }\n\n    .ca-wrap {\n      padding: 0 20px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero {\n      min-height: 900px;\n      height: 96vh;\n      max-height: 980px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero img {\n      object-position: center bottom;\n      filter: brightness(1.18) contrast(1.04);\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero::after {\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(\n          180deg,\n          rgba(0,0,0,.82) 0%,\n          rgba(0,0,0,.68) 25%,\n          rgba(0,0,0,.22) 54%,\n          rgba(0,0,0,.05) 76%,\n          rgba(0,0,0,.18) 100%\n        );\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero-content {\n      align-items: stretch;\n      height: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero-copy {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      max-width: 100%;\n      padding: 62px 16px 210px;\n      display: block;\n    }\n\n    .ca-eyebrow {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero-title {\n      font-size: 48px;\n      line-height: .94;\n      letter-spacing: -.055em;\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n      max-width: 340px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero-title span {\n      white-space: normal;\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero-text {\n      font-size: 19px;\n      line-height: 1.55;\n      max-width: 350px;\n      margin-bottom: 0;\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero .ca-buttons {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 16px;\n      right: 16px;\n      bottom: 28px;\n      margin-top: 0;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 12px;\n      align-items: center;\n      width: auto;\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero .ca-btn {\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 275px;\n      min-width: 275px;\n      min-height: 58px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      padding: 0 18px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-story {\n      padding: 58px 0 0;\n    }\n\n    .ca-story-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 30px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-story h2,\n    .ca-values h2,\n    .ca-visit h2,\n    .ca-final h2 {\n      font-size: 32px;\n      line-height: 1.06;\n    }\n\n    .ca-story p {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.8;\n    }\n\n    /* Hide the single \"Our Story\" photo on mobile only (kept on desktop) */\n    .ca-story-image {\n      display: none !important;\n    }\n\n    .ca-strip {\n      padding: 22px 0 50px;\n    }\n\n    /* Image collage on mobile: two photos on top, one wide photo below */\n    .ca-strip-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-strip-img {\n      min-height: 180px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-img-right {\n      grid-column: 1 / span 2;\n      min-height: 210px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-strip-caption {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      padding: 0 20px;\n      margin-top: 18px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-values {\n      padding: 52px 0 60px;\n    }\n\n    /* \"What Carbon Stands For\" on mobile: compact icon-list rows */\n    .ca-values-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 12px;\n      margin-top: 30px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-value-card {\n      display: grid !important;\n      grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr;\n      grid-template-areas:\n        \"icon title\"\n        \"icon text\";\n      column-gap: 16px;\n      row-gap: 4px;\n      align-items: center;\n      text-align: left !important;\n      padding: 18px 16px !important;\n      min-height: 0 !important;\n      border-radius: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-value-icon {\n      grid-area: icon;\n      width: 60px !important;\n      height: 60px !important;\n      margin: 0 !important;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #f1f1f1;\n    }\n\n    .ca-value-icon img {\n      width: 42px !important;\n      height: 42px !important;\n    }\n\n    .ca-value-card h3 {\n      grid-area: title;\n      align-self: end;\n      margin: 0 !important;\n      font-size: 18px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-value-card p {\n      grid-area: text;\n      align-self: start;\n      margin: 0 !important;\n      font-size: 14px !important;\n      line-height: 1.45 !important;\n      max-width: none !important;\n      font-weight: 500 !important;\n      color: #555;\n    }\n\n    .ca-visit-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .ca-visit-copy {\n      padding: 52px 24px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-visit-copy p {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      line-height: 1.65;\n    }\n\n    .ca-visit-copy .ca-buttons {\n      justify-content: center;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n\n    .ca-visit-copy .ca-btn {\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 280px;\n      min-width: 280px;\n      min-height: 58px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-visit-photo {\n      min-height: 340px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-final {\n      padding: 58px 20px 66px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-final p {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      line-height: 1.65;\n      max-width: 330px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"carbon-about-final\">\n\n\n  <section class=\"ca-hero\">\n    <picture>\n      <source media=\"(max-width: 749px)\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_03_57_17_AM.png?v=1781251065\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_03_53_58_AM.png?v=1781251036\" alt=\"CARBON fashion models wearing modern streetwear\"></source></picture>\n\n    <div class=\"ca-hero-content\">\n\n      <div class=\"ca-hero-copy\">\n\n        <div class=\"ca-eyebrow\">Acerca de Carbon</div>\n\n\n        <h1 class=\"ca-hero-title\">\n\n          <span>Diseñado para</span>\n          <span>la Individualidad</span>\n        </h1>\n\n\n        <p class=\"ca-hero-text\">\n          CARBON es un destino de moda para personas que se visten con confianza,\n          energía y su propio punto de vista.\n        </p>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ca-buttons\">\n\n          <a class=\"ca-btn ca-btn-white\" href=\"/collections/new-arrivals\">\n            Comprar Novedades\n          </a>\n\n          <a class=\"ca-btn ca-btn-outline\" href=\"/pages/retail-store-locator\">\n            Visita Nuestra Tienda\n          </a>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ca-story\">\n    <div class=\"ca-wrap\">\n\n      <div class=\"ca-story-grid\">\n\n        <div>\n\n          <h2>Nuestra Historia</h2>\n\n\n          <p>\n            CARBON fue creado para personas que no quieren pasar desapercibidas. Inspirado en la\n            moda europea, la cultura callejera y la confianza diaria, reunimos\n            piezas a la vanguardia de las tendencias, básicos elevados, denim, looks llamativos\n            y accesorios diseñados para el día a día.\n          </p>\n\n\n          <p>\n            Creemos que la moda debe sentirse actual, audaz, ponible y personal —\n            algo que te ayude a expresar quién eres sin esforzarte demasiado.\n          </p>\n\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ca-story-image\"></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ca-strip\">\n    <div class=\"ca-wrap\">\n\n      <div class=\"ca-strip-grid\">\n\n        <div class=\"ca-strip-img ca-img-left\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"ca-strip-img ca-img-middle\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"ca-strip-img ca-img-right\"></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"ca-strip-caption\">\n\n        Piezas para el día a día. Energía impactante. Tu propio estilo.\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ca-values\">\n    <div class=\"ca-wrap\">\n\n      <h2>Lo que Carbon Representa</h2>\n\n\n      <div class=\"ca-values-grid\">\n\n        <div class=\"ca-value-card\">\n\n          <div class=\"ca-value-icon\">\n\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_08_13_36_PM_1.png?v=1781309859\" alt=\"Individuality icon\">\n          </div>\n\n          <h3>Individualidad</h3>\n\n          <p>El estilo debe sentirse personal, expresivo y fiel a ti.</p>\n\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ca-value-card\">\n\n          <div class=\"ca-value-icon\">\n\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_08_13_36_PM_2.png?v=1781309833\" alt=\"Confidence icon\">\n          </div>\n\n          <h3>Confianza</h3>\n\n          <p>Cada pieza es seleccionada para ayudarte a lucir impecable y sentirte lo mejor posible.</p>\n\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ca-value-card\">\n\n          <div class=\"ca-value-icon\">\n\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_08_13_36_PM_3.png?v=1781309822\" alt=\"Versatility icon\">\n          </div>\n\n          <h3>Versatilidad</h3>\n\n          <p>Desde jeans para el día a día hasta looks destacados, CARBON está hecho para la vida real.</p>\n\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ca-visit\">\n    <div class=\"ca-visit-grid\">\n\n      <div class=\"ca-visit-copy\">\n\n        <h2>Visítanos en Orlando</h2>\n\n\n        <p>\n          Experimenta CARBON en persona en nuestra ubicación de Edgewater en Orlando,\n          Florida. Explora las últimas novedades, pruébate tus prendas favoritas\n          y descubre piezas que combinen con tu estilo.\n        </p>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ca-buttons\">\n\n          <a class=\"ca-btn ca-btn-white\" style=\"background:#000;color:#fff!important;border-color:#000;\" href=\"/pages/retail-store-locator\">\n            Encuentra Nuestra Tienda\n          </a>\n\n          <a class=\"ca-btn ca-btn-outline-dark\" href=\"/collections/all\">\n            Comprar Online\n          </a>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"ca-visit-photo\"></div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ca-final\">\n    <h2>Define Tu Estilo.<br>Llévalo A Tu Manera.</h2>\n\n\n    <p>\n      CARBON es más que una marca — es una comunidad construida sobre la confianza,\n      la autoexpresión y el movimiento.\n    </p>\n\n\n    <a class=\"ca-btn ca-btn-white\" href=\"/collections/all\">\n      Comprar Carbon\n    </a>\n  </section>\n\n\n</div>\n"}, "pt": {"title": "SOBRE NÓS", "body_html": "<style>\n  /* =========================\n     REMOVE SHOPIFY DEFAULT ABOUT TITLE / GAP\n  ========================== */\n  #MainContent h1:not(.ca-hero-title),\n  main h1:not(.ca-hero-title),\n  .main-page-title,\n  .page-title,\n  .title-wrapper,\n  .title-wrapper-with-link,\n  .page-header,\n  .page-width--narrow > h1:first-child,\n  .page-width > h1:first-child {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n\n  #MainContent .page-width:has(.carbon-about-final),\n  #MainContent .page-width--narrow:has(.carbon-about-final),\n  #MainContent .rte:has(.carbon-about-final),\n  #MainContent .main-page:has(.carbon-about-final),\n  #MainContent .shopify-section:has(.carbon-about-final),\n  #MainContent [class*=\"section-\"]:has(.carbon-about-final) {\n    max-width: none !important;\n    width: 100% !important;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n  }\n\n  .carbon-about-final {\n    width: 100vw;\n    margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);\n    margin-right: calc(50% - 50vw);\n    margin-top: -208px !important;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #111;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 5;\n  }\n\n  .carbon-about-final * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .ca-wrap {\n    max-width: 1440px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 34px;\n  }\n\n  /* =========================\n     HERO\n  ========================== */\n  .ca-hero {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    min-height: 780px;\n    height: 55vw;\n    max-height: 880px;\n    background: #000;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .ca-hero picture,\n  .ca-hero img {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .ca-hero img {\n    object-fit: cover;\n    object-position: center 47%;\n    filter: brightness(1.2) contrast(1.04);\n  }\n\n  .ca-hero::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    background:\n      linear-gradient(\n        90deg,\n        rgba(0,0,0,.64) 0%,\n        rgba(0,0,0,.54) 28%,\n        rgba(0,0,0,.23) 50%,\n        rgba(0,0,0,.05) 75%,\n        rgba(0,0,0,.04) 100%\n      );\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n\n  .ca-hero-content {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-hero-copy {\n    max-width: 760px;\n    padding-left: clamp(34px, 6vw, 92px);\n    padding-right: 24px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-eyebrow {\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: .18em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-hero-title {\n    display: block !important;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: clamp(58px, 5.2vw, 86px);\n    line-height: .95;\n    letter-spacing: -.045em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    margin: 0 0 22px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-hero-title span {\n    display: block;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .ca-hero-text {\n    color: #fff;\n    max-width: 620px;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    margin: 0 0 30px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-buttons {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 14px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n\n  .ca-btn {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n    min-width: 220px;\n    min-height: 58px;\n    padding: 0 28px;\n    border: 1px solid #fff;\n    text-decoration: none !important;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: .03em;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-btn-white {\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #000 !important;\n  }\n\n  .ca-btn-outline {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: #fff !important;\n  }\n\n  .ca-btn-outline-dark {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: #111 !important;\n    border-color: #111;\n  }\n\n  /* =========================\n     OUR STORY + IMAGE GRID\n  ========================== */\n  .ca-story {\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 92px 0 0;\n  }\n\n  .ca-story-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr;\n    gap: 84px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-story h2,\n  .ca-values h2,\n  .ca-visit h2,\n  .ca-final h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(38px, 3.4vw, 58px);\n    line-height: 1.02;\n    letter-spacing: -.04em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    margin: 0 0 26px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-story p {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    color: #222;\n    margin: 0 0 20px;\n    max-width: 590px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-story-image {\n    width: 100%;\n    min-height: 520px;\n    background-image: url(\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_09_04_04_PM.png?v=1781312658\");\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: center;\n    background-color: #111;\n  }\n\n  .ca-strip {\n    padding: 38px 0 78px;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  .ca-strip-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-strip-img {\n    min-height: 360px;\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: center;\n    background-color: #111;\n  }\n\n  .ca-img-left {\n    background-image: url(\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_08_49_56_PM.png?v=1781311828\");\n  }\n\n  .ca-img-middle {\n    background-image: url(\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/image_10_23c03a5f-148d-4609-b7b5-c4edd6c3da1a.png?v=1781294277\");\n  }\n\n  .ca-img-right {\n    background-image: url(\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_12_30_10_AM.png?v=1781252368\");\n  }\n\n  .ca-strip-caption {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 26px;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    color: #111;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n\n  /* =========================\n     VALUES\n  ========================== */\n  .ca-values {\n    background: #f5f5f5;\n    padding: 82px 0 96px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-values h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(42px, 4vw, 68px);\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  .ca-values-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 30px;\n    margin-top: 48px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-value-card {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid #d8d8d8;\n    padding: 58px 38px !important;\n    min-height: 360px !important;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-value-icon {\n    width: 120px !important;\n    height: 120px !important;\n    margin: 0 auto 28px !important;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-value-icon img {\n    width: 120px !important;\n    height: 120px !important;\n    display: block;\n    object-fit: contain !important;\n  }\n\n  .ca-value-card h3 {\n    margin: 0 0 18px;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: .02em;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n\n  .ca-value-card p {\n    font-size: 26px !important;\n    line-height: 1.55 !important;\n    max-width: 420px !important;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    color: #222;\n    font-weight: 600 !important;\n  }\n\n  /* =========================\n     VISIT\n  ========================== */\n  .ca-visit {\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n\n  .ca-visit-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: .95fr 1.05fr;\n    min-height: 520px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-visit-copy {\n    padding: clamp(50px, 6vw, 90px);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-visit-copy h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(42px, 4vw, 66px);\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-visit-copy p {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    max-width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto 34px;\n    color: #222;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-visit-photo {\n    min-height: 520px;\n    background: #111;\n    background-image: url(\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_12_43_51_AM.png?v=1781252379\");\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: center;\n  }\n\n  .ca-visit-copy .ca-buttons {\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-visit-copy .ca-btn {\n    min-width: 220px;\n    min-height: 60px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    padding: 0 30px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-visit .ca-btn-outline-dark {\n    border-width: 1px;\n  }\n\n  /* =========================\n     FINAL CTA\n  ========================== */\n  .ca-final {\n    position: relative;\n    background: #030303;\n    color: #fff;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 74px 24px 82px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .ca-final::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -120px;\n    top: 20px;\n    width: 420px;\n    height: 420px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.055);\n    transform: rotate(30deg);\n  }\n\n  .ca-final h2 {\n    color: #fff;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .ca-final p {\n    max-width: 760px;\n    margin: 0 auto 28px;\n    color: #ddd;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n\n  .ca-final .ca-btn {\n    min-width: 220px;\n  }\n\n  /* =========================\n     MOBILE\n  ========================== */\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n    .carbon-about-final {\n      margin-top: -132px !important;\n    }\n\n    .ca-wrap {\n      padding: 0 20px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero {\n      min-height: 900px;\n      height: 96vh;\n      max-height: 980px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero img {\n      object-position: center bottom;\n      filter: brightness(1.18) contrast(1.04);\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero::after {\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(\n          180deg,\n          rgba(0,0,0,.82) 0%,\n          rgba(0,0,0,.68) 25%,\n          rgba(0,0,0,.22) 54%,\n          rgba(0,0,0,.05) 76%,\n          rgba(0,0,0,.18) 100%\n        );\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero-content {\n      align-items: stretch;\n      height: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero-copy {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      max-width: 100%;\n      padding: 62px 16px 210px;\n      display: block;\n    }\n\n    .ca-eyebrow {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero-title {\n      font-size: 48px;\n      line-height: .94;\n      letter-spacing: -.055em;\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n      max-width: 340px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero-title span {\n      white-space: normal;\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero-text {\n      font-size: 19px;\n      line-height: 1.55;\n      max-width: 350px;\n      margin-bottom: 0;\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero .ca-buttons {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 16px;\n      right: 16px;\n      bottom: 28px;\n      margin-top: 0;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 12px;\n      align-items: center;\n      width: auto;\n    }\n\n    .ca-hero .ca-btn {\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 275px;\n      min-width: 275px;\n      min-height: 58px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      padding: 0 18px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-story {\n      padding: 58px 0 0;\n    }\n\n    .ca-story-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 30px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-story h2,\n    .ca-values h2,\n    .ca-visit h2,\n    .ca-final h2 {\n      font-size: 32px;\n      line-height: 1.06;\n    }\n\n    .ca-story p {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.8;\n    }\n\n    /* Hide the single \"Our Story\" photo on mobile only (kept on desktop) */\n    .ca-story-image {\n      display: none !important;\n    }\n\n    .ca-strip {\n      padding: 22px 0 50px;\n    }\n\n    /* Image collage on mobile: two photos on top, one wide photo below */\n    .ca-strip-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-strip-img {\n      min-height: 180px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-img-right {\n      grid-column: 1 / span 2;\n      min-height: 210px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-strip-caption {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      padding: 0 20px;\n      margin-top: 18px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-values {\n      padding: 52px 0 60px;\n    }\n\n    /* \"What Carbon Stands For\" on mobile: compact icon-list rows */\n    .ca-values-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 12px;\n      margin-top: 30px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-value-card {\n      display: grid !important;\n      grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr;\n      grid-template-areas:\n        \"icon title\"\n        \"icon text\";\n      column-gap: 16px;\n      row-gap: 4px;\n      align-items: center;\n      text-align: left !important;\n      padding: 18px 16px !important;\n      min-height: 0 !important;\n      border-radius: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-value-icon {\n      grid-area: icon;\n      width: 60px !important;\n      height: 60px !important;\n      margin: 0 !important;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #f1f1f1;\n    }\n\n    .ca-value-icon img {\n      width: 42px !important;\n      height: 42px !important;\n    }\n\n    .ca-value-card h3 {\n      grid-area: title;\n      align-self: end;\n      margin: 0 !important;\n      font-size: 18px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-value-card p {\n      grid-area: text;\n      align-self: start;\n      margin: 0 !important;\n      font-size: 14px !important;\n      line-height: 1.45 !important;\n      max-width: none !important;\n      font-weight: 500 !important;\n      color: #555;\n    }\n\n    .ca-visit-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .ca-visit-copy {\n      padding: 52px 24px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-visit-copy p {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      line-height: 1.65;\n    }\n\n    .ca-visit-copy .ca-buttons {\n      justify-content: center;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n\n    .ca-visit-copy .ca-btn {\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 280px;\n      min-width: 280px;\n      min-height: 58px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-visit-photo {\n      min-height: 340px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-final {\n      padding: 58px 20px 66px;\n    }\n\n    .ca-final p {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      line-height: 1.65;\n      max-width: 330px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"carbon-about-final\">\n\n\n  <section class=\"ca-hero\">\n    <picture>\n      <source media=\"(max-width: 749px)\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_03_57_17_AM.png?v=1781251065\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_03_53_58_AM.png?v=1781251036\" alt=\"modelos de moda CARBON usando streetwear moderno\"></source></picture>\n\n    <div class=\"ca-hero-content\">\n\n      <div class=\"ca-hero-copy\">\n\n        <div class=\"ca-eyebrow\">Sobre a Carbon</div>\n\n\n        <h1 class=\"ca-hero-title\">\n\n          <span>Feito Para a</span>\n          <span>Individualidade</span>\n        </h1>\n\n\n        <p class=\"ca-hero-text\">\n          A CARBON é um destino de moda para pessoas que se vestem com confiança,\n          energia e um ponto de vista próprio.\n        </p>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ca-buttons\">\n\n          <a class=\"ca-btn ca-btn-white\" href=\"/collections/new-arrivals\">\n            Compre os Lançamentos\n          </a>\n\n          <a class=\"ca-btn ca-btn-outline\" href=\"/pages/retail-store-locator\">\n            Visite Nossa Loja\n          </a>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ca-story\">\n    <div class=\"ca-wrap\">\n\n      <div class=\"ca-story-grid\">\n\n        <div>\n\n          <h2>Nossa História</h2>\n\n\n          <p>\n            A CARBON foi criada para pessoas que não querem se misturar. Inspirados pela\n            moda europeia, cultura de rua e confiança diária, reunimos\n            peças que seguem as tendências, básicos elegantes, jeans, looks marcantes\n            e acessórios projetados para acompanhar a vida real.\n          </p>\n\n\n          <p>\n            Acreditamos que a moda deve ser atual, ousada, usável e pessoal —\n            algo que ajude você a expressar quem você é sem muito esforço.\n          </p>\n\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ca-story-image\"></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ca-strip\">\n    <div class=\"ca-wrap\">\n\n      <div class=\"ca-strip-grid\">\n\n        <div class=\"ca-strip-img ca-img-left\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"ca-strip-img ca-img-middle\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"ca-strip-img ca-img-right\"></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"ca-strip-caption\">\n\n        Peças do dia a dia. Energia marcante. Seu próprio estilo.\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ca-values\">\n    <div class=\"ca-wrap\">\n\n      <h2>O Que a Carbon Defende</h2>\n\n\n      <div class=\"ca-values-grid\">\n\n        <div class=\"ca-value-card\">\n\n          <div class=\"ca-value-icon\">\n\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_08_13_36_PM_1.png?v=1781309859\" alt=\"Ícone de individualidade\">\n          </div>\n\n          <h3>Individualidade</h3>\n\n          <p>O estilo deve ser pessoal, expressivo e fiel a você.</p>\n\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ca-value-card\">\n\n          <div class=\"ca-value-icon\">\n\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_08_13_36_PM_2.png?v=1781309833\" alt=\"Ícone de confiança\">\n          </div>\n\n          <h3>Confiança</h3>\n\n          <p>Cada peça é selecionada para ajudar você a parecer elegante e se sentir bem.</p>\n\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ca-value-card\">\n\n          <div class=\"ca-value-icon\">\n\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/6572/2620/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_12_2026_08_13_36_PM_3.png?v=1781309822\" alt=\"Ícone de versatilidade\">\n          </div>\n\n          <h3>Versatilidade</h3>\n\n          <p>De jeans para o dia a dia a looks marcantes, a CARBON é feita para a vida real.</p>\n\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ca-visit\">\n    <div class=\"ca-visit-grid\">\n\n      <div class=\"ca-visit-copy\">\n\n        <h2>Visite-nos em Orlando</h2>\n\n\n        <p>\n          Experimente a CARBON pessoalmente em nossa loja Edgewater em Orlando,\n          Flórida. Explore os últimos lançamentos, experimente seus looks favoritos\n          e descubra peças que combinam com seu estilo.\n        </p>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ca-buttons\">\n\n          <a class=\"ca-btn ca-btn-white\" style=\"background:#000;color:#fff!important;border-color:#000;\" href=\"/pages/retail-store-locator\">\n            Encontre Nossa Loja\n          </a>\n\n          <a class=\"ca-btn ca-btn-outline-dark\" href=\"/collections/all\">\n            Compre Online\n          </a>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"ca-visit-photo\"></div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"ca-final\">\n    <h2>Defina Seu Estilo.<br>Use-o do Seu Jeito.</h2>\n\n\n    <p>\n      A CARBON é mais do que uma marca — é uma comunidade construída sobre confiança,\n      autoexpressão e movimento.\n    </p>\n\n\n    <a class=\"ca-btn ca-btn-white\" href=\"/collections/all\">\n      Compre Carbon\n    </a>\n  </section>\n\n\n</div>\n", "meta_title": "Sobre a Carbon | Nossa História e Filosofia", "meta_description": "A Carbon une a influência europeia às tendências atuais, com roupas e acessórios que se adaptam ao seu estilo de vida."}}